sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant API as VideoController
    participant S as VideoService
    participant R as VideoRepository
    participant DB as Database

    Note over C,DB: Save Video — POST /api/videos
    C->>API: save_video(uploaderId, title, description, videoUrl)
    API->>S: save_video(...)
    S->>S: validate URL + fields
    S->>R: find_by_uploader_and_title()
    R->>DB: SELECT
    S->>R: save(video)
    R->>DB: INSERT
    API-->>C: 201 videoId, uploadDate

    Note over C,DB: Fetch Video — GET /api/videos/{videoId}
    C->>API: fetch_video(videoId)
    API->>S: fetch_video(videoId)
    S->>R: find_by_id(videoId)
    R->>DB: SELECT
    API-->>C: 200 title, description, videoUrl, viewCount

    Note over C,DB: Watch Video — POST /api/videos/watch
    C->>API: watch_video(uploaderId, title)
    API->>S: watch_video(...)
    S->>R: find_by_uploader_and_title()
    R->>DB: SELECT
    S->>R: increment_view_count(videoId)
    R->>DB: UPDATE view_count = view_count + 1
    API-->>C: 200 videoId, viewCount
